OL,3,ACrypto worth billions frozen after
OL,4,Asuspected Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCryptocurrency giant Binance said on
OL,7,FThursday that it has frozen digital
OL,8,Fassets worth around $3bn (#2.24bn) to
OL,9,Fprevent them from being stolen while it
OL,10,Finvestigates a security issue.
OL,12,FThe company said as part of a series of
OL,13,Falerts online that all deposits and
OL,14,Fwithdrawals are temporarily suspended
OL,15,Fwhile its teams conduct security checks
OL,16,Fand that the firm will "cover all
OL,17,Flosses".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
