OL,3,ACrypto worth billions frozen after
OL,4,Asuspected Binance hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo other major crypto platforms,
OL,7,FTether and Circle, said they have also
OL,8,Ffrozen a total of about $2.4bn of
OL,9,Fassets in response to the potential
OL,10,FBinance hack.
OL,12,FBinance has not said how much was
OL,13,Fpotentially stolen but some crypto
OL,14,Fexperts have put the figure at over
OL,15,F$5bn.
